WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.300
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to do at&nbsp;
the Foundation: Dr. Bright! Stop watching Archer!

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.980
An endless life gives one plenty of time to&nbsp;
catch up on all the best tv shows and movies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:14.600
but that doesn't mean it's okay to try and&nbsp;
recreate them in real life! Dr. Bright is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.860
not allowed any funding to replicate the&nbsp;
experiments of Doctor Krieger from Archer.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:23.360
This includes, but is not limited to: the&nbsp;
creation of a half-human half-goat hybrid,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.500
a man-eating radioactive pig, or a&nbsp;
submarine used for smuggling illegal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.120
materials. If it happened on the show,&nbsp;
Dr. Bright is not allowed to try it.

